# Grove's Bounty (CR 715, 601.2d): Bot1 casts Elusive Otter as its Adventure with X = 3 on turn 1 (Black Lotus for GGG and a
# Mox Emerald for the {G}), choosing as it is cast to put one +1/+1 counter on its Ornithopter and two on its Elvish Mystic.
# Each target must get at least one. As it resolves the Adventure is exiled instead of going to the graveyard, and on turn 3
# Bot1 casts the Otter itself from exile for {U}.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Black Lotus
Mox Emerald
Elusive Otter
Ornithopter
Elvish Mystic
Island
Forest x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Elvish Mystic.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Elusive Otter.Cast(X: 3; Ability: Adventure)
Bot1.Divide(Ornithopter: 1; Elvish Mystic: 2)
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
[T1 Bot1.Main2]
? Exile = Elusive Otter
? Bot1.Graveyard = Black Lotus
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = 1
? Bot1.Battlefield.Elvish Mystic.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = 2
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Exile.Elusive Otter.Cast

[Expect]
Exile.Count = 0
Bot1.Battlefield.Elusive Otter.Power = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Power = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Toughness = 3
Bot1.Battlefield.Elvish Mystic.Power = 3
Bot1.Battlefield.Elvish Mystic.Toughness = 3
